{"name":"Penned: Private Notes","dev":"Edwing H Santos Mena","keys":["ios:1480653765"],"ios":{"id":"1480653765","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/penned-private-notes/id1480653765?uo=4","rating":4.63218,"ratings":87,"price":"$4.99","genre":"Productivity","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource112/v4/d7/91/c6/d791c643-c45a-65be-fabd-51fc591c9aa2/bd022012-38a2-4660-a636-9f0b432c7798_Frame_1026.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource112/v4/4e/d0/17/4ed017cf-e1ec-aa87-5d11-26519412aa24/dda6694b-6af8-450f-a3f1-04c6ee532764_Frame_1016.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource122/v4/08/d9/6b/08d96b85-4354-a681-a722-a0a164cdd72b/12e247f7-64db-43f8-80b0-e3a36b77fbe9_Frame_1027.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource112/v4/21/33/1d/21331d5f-8696-7bd0-e9d2-edf3aad70f7f/c1713447-6933-462a-9d47-1d363080bda1_Frame_1023.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource112/v4/bd/d7/a7/bdd7a716-9b29-017f-7fff-9c7a43bd2caf/405870f9-9937-4abe-a878-a3fc28ce1876_Frame_1025.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource112/v4/76/3d/4a/763d4a7a-aad5-a2d3-1a30-12dd857e62ad/88827570-d93d-447d-a053-2f6e854d76e3_Frame_1024.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"Your thoughts deserve privacy. Penned Notes is a minimalist handwriting app that keeps everything on your device.\n\n- Natural Apple Pencil writing\n- AI text recognition (on-device)\n- 100% private - zero cloud required\n- Export beautiful PDFs\n- Smart tagging & search\n- Clean, distraction-free interface\n\nUnlike other note apps, Penned Notes uses Apple's Neural Engine to recognize your handwriting locally and nothing leaves your device. No accounts, no tracking, no subscriptions to complex features you don't need.\n\nPerfect for:\n- Daily journaling\n- Class notes & studying  \n- Meeting notes\n- Sketches & brainstorming\n- Sensitive work documents\n\nPrivacy-first architecture means your notes stay truly yours.\n\nDownload Penned Notes. \n\nWhere your thoughts are penned, not surveilled.","released":"2022-05-30","updated":"2026-01-07","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/6c/af/79/6caf79fc-11d5-68d2-60fd-4dfd796f4572/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220-0.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/6c/af/79/6caf79fc-11d5-68d2-60fd-4dfd796f4572/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220-0.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Productivity","rating":4.63,"ratings":87,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":1,"hn_comments":1,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":4.0,"first":1680783196,"last":1680783196,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":100,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":35467270,"k":"ios:1480653765","type":"story","by":"amanj3777","time":1680783196,"text":"","title":"Digital Notes – Note taking with ease","story_id":35467270,"story_title":"Digital Notes – Note taking with ease","story_score":1,"comments":1,"w":3.0,"u":0,"s":"pos","self":false}],"slug":"penned-private-notes"}